<script setup lang="ts">
import {computed,ref} from 'vue'
const model=ref('metro'),extra=ref(false),selected=ref('A')
const meaning=computed(()=>model.value==='metro'?'示例站点之间有直达连接':model.value==='social'?'一个账号单向关注另一个账号':'两台示例设备之间可以传递消息')
const directed=computed(()=>model.value==='social')
</script>
<template><section class="content-section graph-concept-demo" aria-label="图论交互示意"><div class="section-heading"><h2>同一张图，可以表示什么？</h2></div><p>这是教学示意，不代表真实线路或社交数据。切换问题，观察边的含义。</p><label>建模问题<select v-model="model"><option value="metro">示例地铁连接</option><option value="social">单向关注</option><option value="network">设备通信</option></select></label><svg viewBox="0 0 480 210" role="img" :aria-label="directed?'三个节点与单向关注边':'三个节点与连接边'"><defs><marker id="demo-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="currentColor"/></marker></defs><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" :marker-end="directed?'url(#demo-arrow)':undefined"><line x1="100" y1="92" x2="206" y2="52"/><line x1="266" y1="52" x2="371" y2="92"/><line v-if="extra" x1="104" y1="109" x2="373" y2="109"/></g><g v-for="n in [{id:'A',x:78,y:110},{id:'B',x:240,y:40},{id:'C',x:402,y:110}]" :key="n.id"><circle :cx="n.x" :cy="n.y" r="25" fill="var(--paper)" stroke="currentColor" :stroke-width="selected===n.id?4:2"/><text :x="n.x" :y="n.y+5" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor">{{n.id}}</text></g></svg><div class="demo-actions"><button v-for="n in ['A','B','C']" :key="n" class="button outline small" :aria-pressed="selected===n" @click="selected=n">节点 {{n}}</button><button class="button outline small" :aria-pressed="extra" @click="extra=!extra">{{extra?'移除 A—C 边':'添加 A—C 边'}}</button></div><p><strong>节点 {{selected}}</strong> 表示一个{{model==='metro'?'站点':model==='social'?'账号':'设备'}}。<strong>边</strong> 表示{{meaning}}。{{directed?'箭头区分关系的方向。':'示例关系不区分方向。'}}</p><p class="muted">节点数没有改变；边变化改变的是连接结构。真实问题中，要先说明边表示什么。</p></section></template>
<style scoped>.graph-concept-demo{line-height:1.9}.graph-concept-demo svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:560px;margin:15px auto;color:var(--ink)}.graph-concept-demo select{margin-left:15px;max-width:100%}.demo-actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}</style>
